    {
      "question": "What is Madh Island known for?",
      "answer": "Madh Island is known for its pristine beaches, water sports activities, fishing village charm, and serene island lifestyle away from the hustle of central Mumbai. It's a popular weekend getaway for beach lovers and adventure seekers."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Madh Island has the pin code 400061. Marve Island, located nearby, shares similar postal codes in the 400061-400062 range."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the main areas within Madh Island?",
      "answer": "The main areas within Madh Island are Madh Beach, Marve Beach, Madh Fort area, fishing village settlements, and residential pockets. Marve Island is adjacent and equally popular for water sports and beach activities."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Property prices in Madh Island range from ₹80 lakh to ₹1.5 Cr for residential plots and villas, depending on proximity to the beach and amenities. Rental rates range from ₹18,000 to ₹45,000 per month for 1-2 BHK apartments (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Madh Island is accessible via the Madh Causeway from Malad. Local auto-rickshaws and taxis are the primary transport. The nearest railway station is Malad (Western Line), about 15-20 minutes away. BEST buses connect to Malad and nearby areas."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are in Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Madh Island has basic medical facilities and clinics. For major healthcare, residents rely on hospitals in nearby Malad and Borivali - Fortis Hospital, Nanavati Max, and Lilavati Hospital are within 20-30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are in Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Madh Island has a few local schools including Madh Island School and some smaller institutions. For higher education, students typically commute to Malad and Borivali schools."
    },
    {
      "question": "What water sports are available in Madh Island?",
      "answer": "Madh Island offers jet skiing, parasailing, banana boat rides, windsurfing, and scuba diving. Multiple water sports operators run seasonal activities, especially during October to May."
    }
